1
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:29,330
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:32,940
[Episode 16]

3
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:34,660
As long as he dies,

4
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,390
you two will love each other forever.

5
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,840
Then my sister's sacrifice
won't be in vain.

6
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:39,710
Xiao He!

7
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,150
Sister!

8
00:01:13,150 --> 00:01:14,039
Sister!

9
00:01:15,039 --> 00:01:15,920
Sister!

10
00:01:17,550 --> 00:01:21,640
♪ I was here ♪

11
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,350
Sister.

12
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:22,150
Qiu.

13
00:01:21,990 --> 00:01:29,350
♪ Now I have to go ♪

14
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:29,120
Xiao He.

15
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Sister!

16
00:01:35,070 --> 00:01:36,680
You're alive!

17
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:40,620
You've grown up.

18
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,950
What did I tell you?

19
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,450
What are we?

20
00:01:51,090 --> 00:01:54,450
We are Tree Spirits.

21
00:01:53,530 --> 00:01:56,420
♪ I won't fall in a cage ♪

22
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,310
We can't hurt people.

23
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:59,020
♪ Missing old days ♪

24
00:01:57,789 --> 00:01:59,280
Then what are you doing right now?

25
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:01,230
♪ I'll be there ♪

26
00:01:59,280 --> 00:01:59,759
I...

27
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:01,870
But...

28
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:05,270
♪ I will hold my ground here ♪

29
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,710
But he took you away first!

30
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:06,510
He separated us!

31
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:08,520
♪ Let others say what they please ♪

32
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:10,190
General Yu from the past is already dead.

33
00:02:08,990 --> 00:02:11,520
♪ The road ahead holds a bright scenery ♪

34
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,280
Now he is Lin Huai.

35
00:02:11,540 --> 00:02:17,720
♪ I stop right here ♪

36
00:02:13,870 --> 00:02:15,310
If you kill him,

37
00:02:15,630 --> 00:02:17,800
you'll only add to your own sins.

38
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:18,910
But...

39
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:21,370
But he destroyed everything we had!

40
00:02:20,510 --> 00:02:24,220
♪ Now I have to go ♪

41
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:23,520
He destroyed the lover you blessed!

42
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,560
He destroyed our home!

43
00:02:24,570 --> 00:02:30,040
♪ I will live on ♪

44
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,000
I just want you to be safe.

45
00:02:32,190 --> 00:02:37,540
♪ Let others say what they please ♪

46
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,680
You got your memory back?

47
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:47,190
To be precise,

48
00:02:47,190 --> 00:02:48,579
it's the me from my past life.

49
00:02:48,579 --> 00:02:50,090
We osmanthus Tree Spirits

50
00:02:50,190 --> 00:02:52,960
only form our spirit cores

51
00:02:53,190 --> 00:02:54,800
after waking from chaos
to understand the world.

52
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,329
If the core leaves the body,

53
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,200
we must return to our roots

54
00:02:58,220 --> 00:02:59,650
and wait to sprout again.

55
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,400
That's nice.

56
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:05,560
Life and death are in your own hands.

57
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,000
But...

58
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:11,610
the power of immortality
in you and Song Yiqiu

59
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:13,190
is fading.

60
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:19,160
Is it because the painting
Autumn Moon in the Forest  bloomed?

61
00:03:20,710 --> 00:03:23,430
From the moment it bloomed,

62
00:03:23,550 --> 00:03:26,060
time for you and Song Yiqiu was released.

63
00:03:26,310 --> 00:03:27,870
The more flowers bloom,

64
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:29,730
the closer you get to the end.

65
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:35,770
I regret it.

66
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,240
You regret it?

67
00:03:39,150 --> 00:03:41,350
Regret falling in love with Song Yiqiu?

68
00:03:42,970 --> 00:03:44,570
Regret loving her and

69
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,570
ending the immortality...

70
00:03:48,170 --> 00:03:48,890
Do you know?

71
00:03:51,190 --> 00:03:52,590
When she lay in my arms,

72
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,480
her wound not healing,

73
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:55,710
bleeding endlessly,

74
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,960
I finally realized

75
00:04:00,310 --> 00:04:02,750
how cruel ending immortality is.

76
00:04:03,780 --> 00:04:05,180
For the past 3,000 years,

77
00:04:05,690 --> 00:04:07,060
we only parted in life.

78
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,290
But in the years to come,

79
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:14,560
we will eventually be parted by death.

80
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,269
So 3,000 years of time

81
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:20,190
didn't make you happy.

82
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,040
If only...

83
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:26,520
If only you could live
like ordinary people,

84
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:28,920
experiencing birth, aging,
sickness, and death...

85
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:31,750
maybe you could love
and stay together like before,

86
00:04:31,750 --> 00:04:33,070
and grow old together.

87
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,270
Maybe if I stop now,

88
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:42,640
there's still time.

89
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,310
Sister,

90
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:57,690
you will definitely love it here.

91
00:05:58,230 --> 00:05:59,960
There are flowers everywhere.

92
00:06:00,310 --> 00:06:02,640
They call it landscaping.

93
00:06:06,590 --> 00:06:07,390
Sister,

94
00:06:08,250 --> 00:06:10,010
I saw them today.

95
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:11,800
That pair of lovers.

96
00:06:12,820 --> 00:06:13,850
The ones

97
00:06:13,950 --> 00:06:16,270
you blessed with your spirit core.

98
00:06:26,380 --> 00:06:27,020
Sister,

99
00:06:27,590 --> 00:06:30,250
I learned a new way
to weave flower crowns today.

100
00:06:50,570 --> 00:06:51,330
Sister!

101
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:56,240
Xiao He.

102
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:06,070
I thought you were going
to leave me again.

103
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,720
Why are you crying again?

104
00:07:09,050 --> 00:07:10,560
I'm right here, aren't I?

105
00:07:14,770 --> 00:07:16,290
I saw this.

106
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,920
When I tried to teach you as a kid,

107
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,110
you wouldn't learn.

108
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:21,160
Now you figured it out yourself.

109
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:23,390
Still as cute as ever.

110
00:07:25,010 --> 00:07:26,370
Not as cute as you.

111
00:07:32,070 --> 00:07:34,480
All of his vitals are returning to normal.

112
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:37,360
Medically speaking,

113
00:07:37,659 --> 00:07:39,010
he's out of danger.

114
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,320
But he still hasn't woken up.

115
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:42,580
It's been so long.

116
00:07:42,580 --> 00:07:43,840
Why isn't he awake yet?

117
00:07:45,590 --> 00:07:46,980
That's the problem.

118
00:07:47,510 --> 00:07:49,170
His cerebral cortex activity

119
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:51,920
is higher than a normal state.

120
00:07:53,510 --> 00:07:54,540
To be precise,

121
00:07:55,310 --> 00:07:56,370
his consciousness

122
00:07:56,830 --> 00:07:58,560
is fighting against waking up.

123
00:08:00,310 --> 00:08:01,230
I see.

124
00:08:02,930 --> 00:08:03,850
Got it.

125
00:08:04,190 --> 00:08:05,250
Thank you, doctor.

126
00:08:05,950 --> 00:08:07,120
Talk to him more.

127
00:08:07,140 --> 00:08:08,510
Call me if you need anything.

128
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:09,150
Thanks.

129
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:39,440
Mr. Ning.

130
00:08:40,370 --> 00:08:41,429
Manager Qing Yuan,

131
00:08:41,630 --> 00:08:42,409
why are you here?

132
00:08:42,409 --> 00:08:44,020
I heard Miss Song was ill,

133
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:46,570
so I came by
on behalf of the auction house.

134
00:08:47,010 --> 00:08:48,410
Just a little something.

135
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:50,600
Thank you.

136
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,320
Miss Song is

137
00:08:55,750 --> 00:08:57,210
recovering very quickly.

138
00:08:57,510 --> 00:08:59,570
She's already out of bed and walking.

139
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:01,000
The one

140
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,660
lying there is...

141
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:06,870
Director Lin was also injured?

142
00:09:08,830 --> 00:09:09,810
They were robbed on the road.

143
00:09:09,810 --> 00:09:11,330
They were just startled.

144
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:13,560
They didn't suffer any major injuries.

145
00:09:13,570 --> 00:09:15,030
Good to hear they're okay.

146
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:17,750
So,

147
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:20,670
Miss Song and Director Lin
are quite close.

148
00:09:21,420 --> 00:09:24,030
The way she looks at him
is very different.

149
00:09:24,390 --> 00:09:25,070
Looks like

150
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:28,160
you have some strong competition.

151
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:36,230
In an auction, the highest bidder wins.

152
00:09:37,140 --> 00:09:38,320
But in love,

153
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:41,460
sometimes it's not about
who bids the highest,

154
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:42,430
but about

155
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:44,440
who is more sincere.

156
00:09:45,250 --> 00:09:46,250
Good luck to you.

157
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:52,600
Lin Huai.

158
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,120
Lin Huai,

159
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,670
do you know that

160
00:10:07,270 --> 00:10:08,200
when I saw you again,

161
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:10,320
looking so free and vibrant,

162
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,910
I was so happy?

163
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:15,960
Because

164
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,790
this is the life your past self

165
00:10:18,830 --> 00:10:20,920
fought so hard for.

166
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,000
It's so great!

167
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,630
You're warm,

168
00:10:24,630 --> 00:10:25,630
and alive.

169
00:10:27,620 --> 00:10:29,220
It's so great.

170
00:10:32,750 --> 00:10:34,030
But I didn't expect

171
00:10:35,870 --> 00:10:37,480
that you, like us,

172
00:10:40,620 --> 00:10:43,190
have been trapped for 3,000 years.

173
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,790
None of us are

174
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,790
truly living,

175
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:53,240
nor have we ever truly lived.

176
00:10:55,930 --> 00:10:57,800
Forget all this, Lin Huai.

177
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:01,010
When you wake up this time,

178
00:11:04,750 --> 00:11:06,540
just be the Lin Huai you are now.

179
00:11:08,510 --> 00:11:10,030
I hope in this lifetime,

180
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:15,030
you can live your life well.

181
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:18,200
Enjoy your life.

182
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,070
Qiu.

183
00:11:52,540 --> 00:11:53,920
Qing Yuan from the auction house

184
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:54,780
came to see you.

185
00:11:55,390 --> 00:11:57,140
Here are the flowers and fruits
she brought.

186
00:11:57,140 --> 00:11:58,810
Word travels fast with them.

187
00:12:01,630 --> 00:12:02,440
Qiu,

188
00:12:03,910 --> 00:12:06,170
you're not recovering as fast as before.

189
00:12:07,190 --> 00:12:09,120
Please take good care of yourself.

190
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:14,940
Ning Changyue,

191
00:12:17,990 --> 00:12:19,150
let's talk.

192
00:12:24,950 --> 00:12:25,590
No rush.

193
00:12:26,090 --> 00:12:28,150
We can talk after you're discharged.

194
00:12:31,770 --> 00:12:32,650
Ning Changyue!

195
00:12:33,910 --> 00:12:35,310
I'll go buy you some food.

196
00:13:06,180 --> 00:13:07,710
Where's my osmanthus cake?

197
00:13:07,790 --> 00:13:08,480
I ate it.

198
00:13:08,660 --> 00:13:09,460
Buy some more.

199
00:13:09,540 --> 00:13:10,540
Go buy it!

200
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,160
Beg me.

201
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:25,410
Ning, we're back!

202
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:28,910
Where is he?

203
00:13:30,070 --> 00:13:31,220
Upstairs maybe?

204
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:33,200
Ning!

205
00:13:43,270 --> 00:13:43,670
Qiu,

206
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,390
his things are gone.

207
00:13:45,390 --> 00:13:47,190
His phone won't connect either.

208
00:13:52,910 --> 00:13:54,680
Your collection has been sold.

209
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:58,010
The proceeds have been deposited
into your account.

210
00:13:58,590 --> 00:13:59,650
Manager Qing Yuan,

211
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:00,770
do me a favor.

212
00:14:01,470 --> 00:14:02,070
I

213
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,570
have to go on a long trip.

214
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:06,680
I have some pieces

215
00:14:06,870 --> 00:14:09,130
I'd like the auction house to sell for me.

216
00:14:09,430 --> 00:14:11,000
Sure, Mr. Ning.

217
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,360
When the time comes,

218
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:14,320
the funds will be deposited

219
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,880
into the account you left with us.

220
00:14:15,880 --> 00:14:17,850
Deposit it into Song Yiqiu's account.

221
00:14:17,850 --> 00:14:18,640
Okay.

222
00:14:23,050 --> 00:14:25,380
Pulling this trick again, Ning Changyue.

223
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:31,390
Qiu.

224
00:14:46,020 --> 00:14:47,450
You're quite generous.

225
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:05,670
Qiu,

226
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,310
everything's done.

227
00:15:07,310 --> 00:15:08,170
I'm exhausted.

228
00:15:08,390 --> 00:15:09,480
Moving all this stuff here...

229
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,080
I'm telling you,

230
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,120
was no joke.

231
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:13,360
But

232
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:15,390
why did we move them to the riverbank?

233
00:15:15,390 --> 00:15:17,390
In this weather, they'll get damp easily.

234
00:15:17,390 --> 00:15:18,360
These are antique trunks.

235
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:19,990
They shouldn't touch the ground
for too long.

236
00:15:19,990 --> 00:15:20,590
By the way,

237
00:15:20,750 --> 00:15:21,630
does Ning know?

238
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:23,470
Should we let him know?

239
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:24,630
Open them.

240
00:15:24,930 --> 00:15:26,050
Open them? Okay.

241
00:15:31,890 --> 00:15:32,370
This...

242
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:33,080
Qiu,

243
00:15:33,750 --> 00:15:35,870
all these things look so valuable!

244
00:15:35,870 --> 00:15:36,800
Throw them away.

245
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:39,930
Throw them away?

246
00:15:41,270 --> 00:15:41,750
Wait,

247
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:42,510
Qiu,

248
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:43,750
could this be some...

249
00:15:43,750 --> 00:15:45,550
Southern Qin bronze ware?

250
00:15:45,640 --> 00:15:47,240
No, we can't throw this away.

251
00:15:48,460 --> 00:15:49,150
Wait,

252
00:15:49,170 --> 00:15:49,720
Qiu.

253
00:15:49,750 --> 00:15:51,370
Why are you throwing away
all these treasures?

254
00:15:51,370 --> 00:15:52,250
Don't!

255
00:15:53,150 --> 00:15:54,080
This is worth a lot of money!

256
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:54,390
Seriously,

257
00:15:54,390 --> 00:15:55,200
why are you throwing away

258
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:56,410
such precious things?

259
00:15:56,410 --> 00:15:57,980
Both of you think these are treasures.

260
00:15:57,980 --> 00:15:59,220
Then you take them!

261
00:16:00,510 --> 00:16:00,990
But...

262
00:16:13,470 --> 00:16:14,600
Okay, let's dump them...

263
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:15,360
dump them.

264
00:16:15,670 --> 00:16:16,270
All of them.

265
00:16:16,270 --> 00:16:17,000
Don't worry.

266
00:16:18,630 --> 00:16:21,270
I... I'll help you throw them?

267
00:16:21,390 --> 00:16:23,150
Tang Dynasty pearls?

268
00:16:23,150 --> 00:16:24,200
Throw away?

269
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:26,750
This...

270
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:30,670
This is top-tier yellow jade
from the Song Dynasty.

271
00:16:31,140 --> 00:16:32,210
Throw this too.

272
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,550
This whistle...

273
00:16:34,910 --> 00:16:36,610
Can't really tell what this is.

274
00:16:36,610 --> 00:16:38,420
This is Song... Song Dynasty?

275
00:16:39,290 --> 00:16:41,260
Tang Dynasty? Song Dynasty?

276
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,030
Stupid brain, think fast!

277
00:16:44,030 --> 00:16:45,270
Think fast!

278
00:16:45,270 --> 00:16:46,470
What dynasty is this?

279
00:17:10,930 --> 00:17:14,530
♪ Hard to write destiny in a few scrolls ♪

280
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:16,670
♪ Karma remains incomplete ♪

281
00:17:17,260 --> 00:17:21,030
♪ Past memories burn to ashes at sunset ♪

282
00:17:21,050 --> 00:17:23,980
♪ Cooling the old window sill ♪

283
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:28,730
♪ Gazing across lifetimes
the obsession won't break ♪

284
00:17:28,750 --> 00:17:31,380
♪ Who can bear the regret? ♪

285
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,460
Over the past 3,000 years,

286
00:17:31,610 --> 00:17:35,360
♪ Three thousand years
can't solve this game ♪

287
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,480
the mementos you casually tossed aside

288
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:35,350
or were forced to leave behind...

289
00:17:35,390 --> 00:17:38,990
♪ Unwillingness in the cycle
of reincarnation ♪

290
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,800
whatever I could recover

291
00:17:39,020 --> 00:17:41,050
♪ Watching time flow ♪

292
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:40,110
is all right here.

293
00:17:41,070 --> 00:17:42,950
♪ Hearing the years sigh softly ♪

294
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:45,740
♪ Immortality still
cannot bring fulfillment ♪

295
00:17:45,770 --> 00:17:47,930
♪ Let fate tear everything apart ♪

296
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:47,110
Call me anytime.

297
00:17:47,950 --> 00:17:49,830
♪ Our bond exists only because ♪

298
00:17:49,850 --> 00:17:52,960
♪ I don't want to leave regrets behind ♪

299
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,640
So this is what you meant by...

300
00:17:53,340 --> 00:17:55,360
♪ Willing to give up immortality ♪

301
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:56,830
our shared memories
from the past 3,000 years.

302
00:17:55,390 --> 00:17:57,150
♪ To face hardships together ♪

303
00:17:57,190 --> 00:18:00,160
♪ Don't ask how absurd the ending may be ♪

304
00:18:00,190 --> 00:18:02,480
♪ I only want to use this lifetime ♪

305
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:05,860
♪ To trade it for eternity ♪

306
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:09,490
♪ Could we find our happy ending? ♪

307
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:05,450
I thought you'd never blow it again.
